    exact E1QubitPlacement.entry1_eq L hw hn kx ky s X.val X.isLt Y G
      v.x v.y v.generic v.clean m1 m2
  · simpa only [entryStage,division,entry_split,List.append_assoc] using prior

                                                                         
                                                                                  
                               
                                                                                   
                          
                                                                  
                                                                        
                                                                                
                                                             
                                                
                                           
                                                                   
                                                                                     
                                              
                                             
                                           
                                           
                                     
                                     
                                                                                             
                            
                   
                                                                      
                                                                                     

